#. <CLT 23>「ガチャリ…」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Click*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>情報処理室のドアを閉めた途端、
#. そんな妙な音が聞こえた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As soon as the door to the data center was closed, I\n"
"heard a strange sound.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 今の音って…？
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What was that...?"
msgstr ""

#. あ！　鍵が閉まってる！！
#. 情報処理室の鍵が閉まっちゃったよ！！
msgctxt "0004 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Ah! The door! It just locked on its own!"
msgstr ""

#. …え！？
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>すぐに、手を離したばかりのドアノブを掴んだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>My hand shot out to grab the doorknob...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「ガチャ…ガチャ…」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Rattle rattle*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ホントだ…鍵が締まってる…
#. でも、どうして…？
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You're right, it's locked. But...why?"
msgstr ""

#. 鍵が締まって当然だよ。
#. 情報処理室は封鎖したんだもん。
msgctxt "0009 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Of course it's locked! Because the data center is now\n"
"restricted!"
msgstr ""

#. モ、モノクマ…！？
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "M-Monokuma!?"
msgstr ""

#. ちょっと！　ずるいよ！
#. 勝手に封鎖なんて！
msgctxt "0011 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Hey, no fair! You can't just go around restricting\n"
"whatever you feel like!"
msgstr ""

#. これはね、オマエラの為でもあるんだよ…
msgctxt "0012 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "It's for YOUR benefit!"
msgstr ""

#. だって、あの部屋を開放したままだと、
#. ボクを動かせなくなっちゃうでしょ？
msgctxt "0013 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Cuz if that room stays open, I won't be able\n"
"to move around."
msgstr ""

#. マスコット的存在のボクがいなくなった時の
#. 空気の悪さを想像してごらんよ！
msgctxt "0014 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Imagine how depressed everyone would get if the school\n"
"mascot just up and stopped moving!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、やっぱり…さっきの部屋って…
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Then...that room..."
msgstr ""

#. ご察しの通り、ボクを操作する為の部屋だよ！
msgctxt "0016 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "As you may have guessed, that's where my controls are!"
msgstr ""

#. だったら、今のあんたも…
#. あの部屋で<CLT 3>“誰か”<CLT>が操作してるって事…？
msgctxt "0017 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"So...right now, you're being operated by <CLT 3>someone<CLT> in\n"
"that room?"
msgstr ""

#. えぇ、そうなりますね。
msgctxt "0018 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Correctamundo!"
msgstr ""

#. そんなのおかしいよ！
msgctxt "0019 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "But that doesn't make any sense!"
msgstr ""

#. 今、あの部屋を調べた時は、
#. 中に人なんていなかったもん！
msgctxt "0020 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "We were just in there, and we didn't see anyone!"
msgstr ""

#. 人はいなかった…？
msgctxt "0021 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Oh you didn't, did you?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…ちゃんと調べたのかしら…？
msgctxt "0022 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Puhuhu... Are you sure you were as thorough as you\n"
"could have been?"
msgstr ""

#. 怪しい扉とか…ちゃんと調べたのかしら…？
msgctxt "0023 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Did you happen to check...a certain suspicious hatch?"
msgstr ""

#. ま、まさか…！
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "N-No way...!"
msgstr ""

#. 床の扉…？
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The hatch on the floor!?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ、残念でしたね！
#. ビッグチャンスを逃してしまいましたね！
msgctxt "0026 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Puhuhu, too bad! That was your one big chance, and ya\n"
"blew it!"
msgstr ""

#. まぁ、どっちにしろ、床の扉は内鍵だから、
#. 外から開けられないんだけどね！
msgctxt "0027 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Of course, that hatch can't be opened from the outside\n"
"anyway. So whatever!"
msgstr ""

#. …とにかく、この部屋に関しては、
#. もう封鎖したので捜査は出来ません。
msgctxt "0028 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Now then, this room is officially restricted. So no\n"
"more investigating!"
msgstr ""

#. なので、オマエラが責任を持って、
#. 他のみんなに教えてあげてくださいね。
msgctxt "0029 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I'll be relying on you guys to tell the others."
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷぷ！　さいならー！
msgctxt "0030 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Puhuhu... Peace!"
msgstr ""

#. 行っちゃった…けど…
msgctxt "0031 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "He's gone. But..."
msgstr ""

#. 本当…だったのかな…？
#. 黒幕が…隠れてたなんて…
msgctxt "0032 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"...was he telling the truth? The mastermind was hiding\n"
"in there?"
msgstr ""

#. 実際に、部屋を封鎖された事から考えると…
#. 多分…本当だと思うよ…
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"In fact, if you think back to when we got locked out\n"
"of the control room, that proves it for sure."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…私が部屋を出ようなんて言ったせいで…
msgctxt "0034 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Then...when I said we should leave..."
msgstr ""

#. …いや、あいつが隠れてたって扉も、
#. どうせ外からは開けられなかったらしいし…
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Well, that hatch couldn't be opened from the outside\n"
"anyway, right?"
msgstr ""

#. だから、朝日奈さんのせいじゃないよ。
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So it's not your fault."
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…
msgctxt "0037 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "O-Okay..."
msgstr ""

#. 待って、落ち込んでるヒマはないよ。
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Anyway, we don't have to let it get to us."
msgstr ""

#. 残された時間は少ないんだし、
#. その中で出来る事を前向きに考えないと…
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"We have to stay positive and make the most of the time\n"
"we have left!"
msgstr ""

#. そう…だよね…
msgctxt "0040 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "You're right..."
msgstr ""

#. 私に出来る事って言ったら…
#. 体を使う事くらいだし…
msgctxt "0041 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"If there's one thing I'm good at, it's keeping my body\n"
"moving...!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、あの部屋の事をみんなに伝えるのは任せて！
#. 私が走り回って、みんなに伝えてくるから！
msgctxt "0042 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Okay! I'm gonna go run around and tell everyone what\n"
"we found here!"
msgstr ""

#. よーしっ！　苗木のお陰で、
#. やる気が出て来たよ！
msgctxt "0043 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Nice! You've got me all motivated again!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、さっそく行って来るよ！
#. また後でねっ！！
msgctxt "0044 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Okay, I'm out! See ya later!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう言って、朝日奈さんは全速力で
#. 走り去っていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hina took off at a full sprint.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. そうだ…！
#. ボクも自分に出来る事をやらないとな…！
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And I have to do what I can, too...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それしか…道はないんだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's the only way forward!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここは女子トイレだ…
#. もちろん、入る訳にはいかない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is the girls bathroom. Obviously I can't go in...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「ガチャ、ガチャ…」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Rattle rattle*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>駄目だ、鍵が掛かってる。
#. やっぱり情報処理室は封鎖されたんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Definitely locked. I figured I wouldn't be able to get\n"
"into the data center...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
